  "update_count": 65,
  "description_snippet": "### Summary\n\nOOB occurs in Blink's WebAudio `DirectConvolver` when `OfflineAudioContext` is configured with a `renderSizeHint` smaller than 128. The `UpSampler` used by `WaveShaperNode` creates a [`DirectConvolver`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/"
}